From 531ff64e1854896397c429d8c8a360c69870951a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: terminills <tdeters@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 01:30:55 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 524/638] Fix AROS Chromium shutdown cleanup races

Clean up AROS message pump and singleton native ports at process exit, suppress worker resource scheduler wakes during shutdown cancellation, guard cache and media teardown paths, and release Ozone native ports before the AROS shell checks command signal ownership.\n\nEvidence:\n- ninja -C out/aros-chrome chrome -j32 (build115) linked cleanly.\n- Hosted YouTube replay run29 drew the YouTube player, closed Chromium, and returned chrome status 0 with no unfreed-signal lines visible in the post-close shell screenshot.\n- Earlier run28 verified the message pump fix removed 0x10000/0x20000; build115 removed the remaining 0x200000/0x400000 shell leak lines.
---
